sode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:02:00.09,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:58.10,0:01:59.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my Star Shield.Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.14,0:02:02.48,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What's up with this guy's body?Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.48,0:02:05.52,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He's no longer human!Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.11,0:02:06.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flames again?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.98,0:02:08.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master Nail!Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.03,0:02:10.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moon Walk!Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.49,0:02:17.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He keeps jumping outta the way! We're getting nowhere like this!Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.37,0:02:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like my four powers aren't much use here.Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.12,0:02:26.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apologies, but since I haven't mastered finger pistol yet,Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.71,0:02:28.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll have to use some props!Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.25,0:02:31.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright! This is my chance to go to the next car!Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.05,0:02:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold it, you bastard!Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.42,0:02:34.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't take your eyes off him!Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.01,0:02:39.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He fell for it.Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.35,0:02:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beans Left!Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.10,0:02:46.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too bad...Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.69,0:02:48.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I figured...Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.48,0:02:50.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'd do something like that!Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.53,0:02:58.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow...!Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.37,0:03:01.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.29,0:03:04.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch...Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouchie Finger!Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.37,0:03:06.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.67,0:03:09.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit...Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.17,0:03:11.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's figured me out...Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.34,0:03:14.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.34,0:03:17.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That one grazed me!Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.01,0:03:18.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He sure moves around a lot!Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.81,0:03:22.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So your weak point...Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is your back, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.52,0:03:29.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I can see through your cheap tricks.Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.15,0:03:33.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before I win, isn't it?Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.53,0:03:35.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky!Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.90,0:03:39.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have no weak point if I do this.Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky...Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.78,0:03:42.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Invincible!Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.16,0:03:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tada!Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.88,0:03:49.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give up yet, you stupid weasel?Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.96,0:03:52.25,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,How do you even respond to that...?Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.25,0:03:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But really, dude, you've got some terrible luck.Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.13,0:04:00.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've gone and pissed me off…Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.01,0:04:04.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I happen to be especially super this week.Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.39,0:04:07.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, buddy...Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.52,0:04:10.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ever heard of a centaur?Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.52,0:04:16.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The horse monster that's human from the waist up?Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.90,0:04:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about it?Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.57,0:04:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Con... vert!Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's gonna...Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.10,0:04:48.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky...Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.10,0:04:50.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Centaur!Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.60,0:04:54.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's backwards! Your body goes in front!Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.53,0:05:01.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't knock it till you've seen its horsepower.Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.61,0:05:03.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! You've got some nerve!Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.08,0:05:06.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My noodle fists are gone!Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.74,0:05:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I...Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.50,0:05:10.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,an onion or something?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.21,0:05:13.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's pointless to keep fighting.Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.71,0:05:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Accept your loss and let me pass.Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.34,0:05:20.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Accept my loss? Why would I?! Who says I'm losing?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.63,0:05:25.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Wanze, the ace of CP7!Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.43,0:05:29.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you, I understand the importance of this mission.Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.60,0:05:34.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The government has been pursuing your crewmate, Nico Robin, for a long time.Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.31,0:05:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a moron if you think I'd just let you take her!Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.57,0:05:41.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramen Kenpo: Noodle Nail Knocker!Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.00,0:05:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When preparing an onion, you must first cut off the stem and root without bruising the flesh.Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.59,0:05:59.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you slice the fiber in one go...Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.46,0:06:02.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the cut results in a pristine, glossy surface.Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.26,0:06:06.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stay back!Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.18,0:06:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramen Beam!Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.48,0:06:13.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Épluchage!Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.45,0:06:30.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You cut me!Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.79,0:06:37.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? I didn't get cut.Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.75,0:06:41.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And if you don't put love into the smallest of tasks, like peeling skins,Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.63,0:06:44.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it'll spoil the taste of any dish.Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.51,0:06:49.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kitchen knives aren't swords. They're not for cutting people.Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.85,0:06:52.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But in case you hadn't noticed, your armor is–Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.81,0:06:54.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kitchen Knife Throw!Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.40,0:06:57.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You son of a...Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.69,0:06:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Œil!Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.90,0:07:04.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,M-My eyes are caving in!Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.03,0:07:05.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let them.Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.24,0:07:07.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, shut up and surrender.Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.66,0:07:12.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You numbskull! Why would I?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.66,0:07:18.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't get why the heck you would want to rescue a woman like that!Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.42,0:07:23.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys don't actually know Nico Robin's true nature, do you?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.34,0:07:25.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That woman is...Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.13,0:07:26.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nez!Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.18,0:07:27.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Joue!Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.18,0:07:28.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bouche!Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.30,0:07:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dents!Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.39,0:07:30.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Menton!Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.56,0:07:37.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you keep talking, I'm gonna rearrange your face.Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.90,0:07:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-H-Hold on a sec!Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.11,0:07:43.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I feel like my face shrank! Stop it!Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.95,0:07:49.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-If you don't know about her, I'll tell you.Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.78,0:07:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows!Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.45,0:07:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's a depraved devil!Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.71,0:07:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Parage... Shot!Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.31,0:08:15.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-D-Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.85,0:08:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My face caved in! Mirror! I need a mirror!Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.11,0:08:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Y-You bastard!Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.24,0:08:35.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-How dare you dent my precious eyes and nose?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.20,0:08:39.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a demon!Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.25,0:08:42.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, they're back to normal.Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.09,0:08:45.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You're right!Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.50,0:08:47.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I felt like they went back a little just now.Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.26,0:08:52.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,G-Guess I just imagined it.Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.68,0:08:55.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're guilty of three sins.Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.22,0:09:00.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, you claimed to be a cook in front of me.Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.98,0:09:05.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Second, you treated food with disrespect.Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.11,0:09:06.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Third...Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.69,0:09:09.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you insulted our friend.Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.37,0:09:23.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the very definition of "all bark, no bite."Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.09,0:09:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, centaur! Those four legs don't appear to be helping much!Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.60,0:09:40.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I-I'm gonna fall!Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.19,0:09:48.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a sorry sight.Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.98,0:09:50.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.32,0:09:53.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Need a hand?Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.83,0:10:00.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You weasel!Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not quite...!Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.85,0:10:22.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna give me a hand?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.60,0:10:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm doing just fine, jackass!Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.73,0:10:28.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've finally got you.Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.57,0:10:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now tell me if you still think my being four-legged was pointless!Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.65,0:10:35.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you jerk!Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.78,0:10:38.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me my signature features back!Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.70,0:10:45.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My friend is waiting to be rescued on the other side of that door you're blocking.Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.75,0:10:52.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I say I won't let you go through, I mean it!Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.63,0:10:56.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Backstreet Ramen Kenpo: Poison Noodle Cleaver!Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.39,0:10:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Touch this, and you're dead!Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.39,0:11:01.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now, now!Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.18,0:11:05.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't you guys being deceived by that woman, too?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.44,0:11:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's the lowest of the low,Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.39,0:11:11.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a serial backstabber who's survived up  until now by hiding in the shadows!Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.40,0:11:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the line for you!Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.24,0:11:15.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.36,0:11:18.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three-Point...Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.33,0:11:20.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Découpage!Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.08,0:12:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's got me completely pinned down!Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.25,0:12:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got careless!Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.42,0:12:12.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Careless?Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.30,0:12:15.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Excuses, excuses.Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.55,0:12:27.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, why don't you take this opportunity to say some final words, buddy?Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.23,0:12:33.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not thinking you're gonna keep fighting after this, are you?Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.52,0:12:34.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.15,0:12:39.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it makes sense when you've been dodging all my attacks.Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.45,0:12:46.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't know how killer my punches really are.Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.46,0:12:50.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ultimate...Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.29,0:12:52.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hammer!Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.21,0:13:34.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, where the hell did you come from?Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.71,0:13:38.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you finish off that ramen guy?Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.76,0:13:40.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep, just now.Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.18,0:13:47.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's getting noisy around here.Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.39,0:13:51.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So the soldiers for this escort mission were annihilated after all?Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.52,0:13:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They were never anything to write home about.Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.52,0:14:00.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who kidnapped Robin, right?Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.36,0:14:03.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be careful. They use strange martial arts.Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.83,0:14:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is this?Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.66,0:14:13.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must be that CP9 greenhorn that Corgi was prattling on about.Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.67,0:14:17.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I recall correctly, he's a four power master named Nero or something.Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.97,0:14:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.63,0:14:25.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get it now!Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.64,0:14:28.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People call me a fighting prodigy!Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.64,0:14:30.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore...Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.60,0:14:32.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're dead meat!Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.14,0:14:36.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, "greenhorn."Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.36,0:14:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You... You must be Rob Lucci, right?Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.36,0:14:42.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the late introduction...Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.44,0:14:44.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One moment, please.Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.07,0:14:46.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just gotta kill this guy, and then...Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.45,0:14:48.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our orders are to capture Franky alive.Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.95,0:14:52.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To put your personal feelings before a mission is...Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, forget it.Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.96,0:14:57.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got three seconds. Start running.Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.80,0:15:00.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three...Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.63,0:15:02.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run...?! From who?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.22,0:15:04.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two...Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.47,0:15:06.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Wait a second!Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.26,0:15:07.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.14,0:15:09.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One.Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.76,0:15:12.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! You're making a mistake!Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.22,0:15:13.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.57,0:15:32.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A person like you who does everything half-assed...Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.91,0:15:36.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is unfit for CP9!Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.25,0:15:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unless you've mastered all six powers, you aren't superhuman, boy.Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.72,0:15:46.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa.Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.59,0:15:47.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.76,0:15:49.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Inform the chief later...Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.93,0:15:54.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that the newbie was too weak to be of any use.Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.18,0:15:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger.Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.64,0:16:00.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These guys stand for justice?Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.11,0:16:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't tell which side is evil, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.61,0:16:10.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess I don't have to ask why you're here, intruder.Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.78,0:16:16.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Given the way you opened that door, you don't seem to have much patience.Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.29,0:16:19.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, guess I wasn't raised right.Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.54,0:16:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this is about Nico Robin...Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.92,0:16:24.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,give it up.Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.38,0:16:29.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're sticking your noses into matters beyond you.Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.09,0:16:33.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are people in the world who are born under unlucky stars...Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.06,0:16:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People who are better off dead for everyone's sake.Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.89,0:16:39.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For example...Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.98,0:16:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suppose a devil exists that could destroy the world.Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.69,0:16:53.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the one with the power to awaken that devil is an innocent, eight-year-old girl,Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.91,0:16:55.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,don't you think...Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.12,0:17:03.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that someone should kill that girl for everyone's sake?Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.71,0:17:06.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you getting at?Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.80,0:17:12.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm explaining Nico Robin's situation to you.Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.14,0:17:16.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These days, she's a fully-fledged criminal...Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.97,0:17:20.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but that was how it all started.Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.14,0:17:25.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For as long as she can remember, her very existence has been a sin.Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.40,0:17:29.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She can only make people happy by disappearing.Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.61,0:17:32.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is the misfortune she carries.Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.66,0:17:39.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Essentially, she should've died 20 years ago.Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.33,0:17:42.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm truly glad that this woman...Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.29,0:17:44.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will finally be put to death.Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.75,0:17:45.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey...Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.09,0:17:51.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough outta you!Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.51,0:17:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.47,0:17:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare say another word!Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.10,0:17:59.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That being said, the government will probably spend many years...Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.56,0:18:10.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,wringing out every drop of Nico Robin's knowledge, experience, and intelligence.Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.45,0:18:16.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't even imagine the agony she'll endure from now until her demise... Just think about–Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.70,0:18:18.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way in hell we'll let that happen!Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.66,0:18:20.70,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, wait, Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.70,0:18:22.71,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't go that way!Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.71,0:18:24.71,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Seriously! Seriously! Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.34,0:18:28.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, I said, wait!Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.42,0:18:32.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.63,0:18:33.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Oh crap...Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.84,0:18:36.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! Are you okay?! Are you hurt?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.85,0:18:39.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is really bad!Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.68,0:18:44.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was one thing getting in from the outside, but then taking out that official...!Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.90,0:18:47.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's Nico Robin?Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.40,0:18:50.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She does kinda look like that photo on the wanted poster.Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.07,0:18:56.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go back together this time!Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.95,0:19:01.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll knock these guys out in no time flat... Alright, Robin?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.71,0:19:10.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.55,0:19:11.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing, Robin?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.76,0:19:21.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow...Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.10,0:19:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if I explain,Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.94,0:19:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you guys won't listen, will you?Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.91,0:19:37.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir Franky!Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.57,0:19:40.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Detach car three!Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.45,0:19:42.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're we gonna do?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.83,0:19:43.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.95,0:19:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.04,0:19:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you mean?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.29,0:19:50.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You, too, make haste! One moment will decide the game!Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.59,0:19:52.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let Franky slip away.Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.71,0:19:53.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger.Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.72,0:19:57.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sogeking...Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.97,0:20:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Smoke Star!Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.89,0:20:07.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a low-down humbug...!Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.15,0:20:11.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.23,0:20:16.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got Nico Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.66,0:20:23.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Put me down!Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.12,0:20:27.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Alright! – Alright!Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.54,0:20:30.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.80,0:20:41.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go baaaack!Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.55,0:20:43.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?! We came all this way!Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.31,0:20:44.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.81,0:20:48.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– That's right! Tell us why! – That's right! Tell us why!Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.02,0:20:50.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not you guys!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.90,0:20:51.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Huh? – Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.98,0:20:58.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That stupid frog jumped on the railway tracks! Go back, froggy! Get away from the train!Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.95,0:21:01.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Yokozuna!Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.41,0:21:02.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Him?Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.20,0:21:06.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What's up with that huge frog?! – What's up with that huge frog?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.33,0:21:07.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch out!Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.79,0:21:10.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get outta the way, frog!Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.54,0:21:15.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.59,0:21:22.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.34,0:21:24.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got Robin back!Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.55,0:21:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that sure surprised me.Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.52,0:21:29.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To think we switched to a strategic retreat...Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.52,0:21:33.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one would expect something as dumb as a smoke screen.Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.82,0:21:41.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's best if we can achieve our goal without fighting scary guys like them.Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.57,0:21:42.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.95,0:21:46.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know if things are gonna be that simple.Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.54,0:21:51.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Don't let your guard down until the cars are really far apart.Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.54,0:21:56.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell...?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.13,0:22:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thorny whips?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.01,0:22:05.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I caught it...Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.43,0:22:07.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueno.Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.64,0:22:08.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right.Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.60,0:22:11.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna cross using the whips?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.73,0:22:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They pulled us back!Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.61,0:22:23.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That power's insane!Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.08,0:22:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A smoke screen? What a pointless trick...Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.95,0:22:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess it was too good to be true.Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.21,0:22:40.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Pirates are to be left alive.Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.21,0:22:43.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was the agreement.Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.55,0:22:45.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sogeking!Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.01,0:22:45.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes?Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.93,0:22:47.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Protect Robin! Got it?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.64,0:22:49.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh...? Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.18,0:22:51.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm going to...Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.56,0:22:53.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,make you let go!Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.73,0:23:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is his body so hard?Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.98,0:23:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you they use weird martial arts?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.54,0:23:12.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Concassé!Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.26,0:23:24.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That boy's kicks are no joke.Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.88,0:23:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He almost broke through iron body.Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.22,0:23:29.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueno, don't take him lightly.Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.80,0:23:33.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He may not have a bounty, but he's one of their heavy hitters.Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.35,0:23:35.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, R-Robin! H-Hey, h-hold on a sec!Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.27,0:23:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow... Wh-What're you doing?Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.65,0:23:40.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ocho Fleur!Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.61,0:23:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clutch!Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.73,0:23:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long Nose!Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.70,0:23:50.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing, Robin?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.87,0:23:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?! Leave me alone!Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.96,0:24:03.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way...Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.34,0:24:05.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay on your toes.Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.60,0:24:15.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eyebrows!Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.02,0:24:20.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For the love of... Why are you all being so stubborn?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.52,0:24:24.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be friends, aren't you?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.61,0:24:27.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.07,0:24:33.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the perfect chance to get away, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.41,0:25:11.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky!Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.16,0:25:17.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was uncalled for.Dialogue: 50,0:25:18.91,0:25:21.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't expect that, did you?Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.50,0:25:26.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you siding with them in the first place?Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.46,0:25:28.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stand watching them act like that.Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.59,0:25:32.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not when there's a team that can't reunite even if they wanted to!Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.30,0:25:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder who you're talking about.Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.14,0:25:39.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys, don't worry about me!Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.77,0:25:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got a plan!Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.14,0:25:44.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once you've joined up with Straw Hat, get back to town somehow!Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.11,0:25:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky!Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.02,0:25:47.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.36,0:25:49.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't run away!Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.07,0:25:52.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Robin.Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.91,0:25:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you still acting like this?Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.24,0:26:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We came to rescue you knowing the full story!Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.71,0:26:05.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we can just do something about the government's buster call,Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.79,0:26:09.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then you wouldn't have a reason to listen to them, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.26,0:26:19.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That buster call...Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.11,0:26:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is precisely the problem.Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.45,0:26:33.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.40,0:26:34.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.54,0:26:39.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.29,0:26:46.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.71,0:26:49.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He came outta nowhere!Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.72,0:26:55.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueno disappeared?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.22,0:26:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He didn't disappear.Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.89,0:27:03.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He used "Air Door"—the power that makes his Door-Door Fruit actually worth something—Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.48,0:27:06.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to create a door in the air itself.Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.60,0:27:09.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't escape from us...Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.57,0:27:11.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's simply not possible.Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.08,0:27:26.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let Robin...Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.79,0:27:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,go–Dialogue: 50,0:27:31.42,0:27:32.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol.Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.89,0:27:41.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.76,0:27:43.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body.Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.35,0:27:48.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling that attack from earlier?Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.86,0:27:50.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That kick was laughable.Dialogue: 50,0:28:04.91,0:28:06.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How stubborn.Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.50,0:28:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.04,0:28:12.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't run away.Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.92,0:28:14.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That should be enough.Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.34,0:28:17.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who keep attacking me.Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.51,0:28:19.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't help it.Dialogue: 50,0:28:20.43,0:28:23.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then let's hurry up and leave.Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.94,0:28:28.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.86,0:28:35.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's okay...Dialogue: 50,0:28:35.11,0:28:36.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin...!Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.61,0:28:40.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything's... gonna be fine...!Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.12,0:28:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're... still hiding something, aren't you?Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.00,0:28:52.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's okay.Dialogue: 50,0:28:53.38,0:28:54.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.80,0:28:55.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a pirate...Dialogue: 50,0:28:57.26,0:29:00.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,cannot leave their crew...Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.84,0:29:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,without their captain's...Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.14,0:29:05.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,permission.Dialogue: 50,0:29:09.06,0:29:10.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So...Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.19,0:29:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just...Dialogue: 50,0:29:14.23,0:29:15.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,believe in Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.96,0:29:36.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.13,0:29:40.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use. Nico Robin will not break the agreement.Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.47,0:29:42.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can you say that?Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.01,0:29:46.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Many years ago, an island was wiped off the map.Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.93,0:29:53.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was burned to the ground without a trace by a buster call...Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.02,0:29:55.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,by order of the Marines.Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.73,0:30:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The only survivor of that incident was a little girl named Nico Robin.Dialogue: 50,0:30:01.45,0:30:02.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:03.36,0:30:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Five vice admirals and ten battleships...Dialogue: 50,0:30:07.33,0:30:11.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To that girl who witnessed such overwhelming military power,Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.91,0:30:15.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the buster call is an inexpungible nightmare.Dialogue: 50,0:30:15.42,0:30:20.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With that horror from her childhood now turned toward her friends...Dialogue: 50,0:30:21.34,0:30:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,she no longer has the will to resist us.Dialogue: 50,0:30:25.22,0:30:26.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...Dialogue: 50,0:30:27.22,0:30:29.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you knew that all along...?Dialogue: 50,0:30:30.89,0:30:32.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course.Dialogue: 50,0:30:36.90,0:30:38.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You monsters...Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.23,0:30:42.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just how depraved are you monsters?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:42.82,0:30:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything we do is for the sake of justice.Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.47,0:30:48.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I deeply sympathize with that woman.Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.74,0:30:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that crap!Dialogue: 50,0:31:09.81,0:31:15.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You damn bastards!Dialogue: 50,0:31:16.81,0:31:19.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the Enies Lobby Management Bureau.Dialogue: 50,0:31:19.61,0:31:21.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is everything in order?Dialogue: 50,0:31:22.28,0:31:26.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're bringing the two criminals in right on schedule.Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.20,0:31:30.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The island is within sight, so we should be arriving shortly.Dialogue: 50,0:31:30.54,0:31:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Understood.Dialogue: 50,0:31:31.79,0:31:34.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, we'll be awaiting your return.Dialogue: 50,0:31:35.54,0:31:39.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After five years away, it truly feels nostalgic.Dialogue: 50,0:31:39.96,0:31:42.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The nightless island, Enies Lobby.Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:53.43,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Necessary EvilDialogu